 gap-2 overflow-x-clip" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><div class="relative w-full text-start"><div class="flex w-full flex-col items-start justify-between text-start"><button class="flex w-full items-center gap-0.5"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 text-start align-middle text-token-text-secondary hover:text-token-text-primary" style="opacity: 1;">Thought for 13 seconds</span><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-sm text-token-text-secondary inline align-middle transition-transform"><path d="M7.52925 3.7793C7.75652 3.55203 8.10803 3.52383 8.36616 3.69434L8.47065 3.7793L14.2207 9.5293C14.4804 9.789 14.4804 10.211 14.2207 10.4707L8.47065 16.2207C8.21095 16.4804 7.78895 16.4804 7.52925 16.2207C7.26955 15.961 7.26955 15.539 7.52925 15.2793L12.8085 10L7.52925 4.7207L7.44429 4.61621C7.27378 4.35808 7.30198 4.00657 7.52925 3.7793Z"></path></svg></button></div></div></span></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="fff4491a-2975-438c-82a1-0be366cac015" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5" data-message-model-slug="o4-mini-high"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light"><p data-start="0" data-end="158">Below is a detailed rebuild plan for <a data-start="37" data-end="60" rel="noopener" target="_new" class="" href="https://townsendsq.com/">https://townsendsq.com/</a>, covering wireframes, code snippets ready for SiteSwan, content strategy, and a rollout schedule.</p>
<hr data-start="160" data-end="163">
<h2 data-start="165" data-end="189">1. Wireframe Overview</h2>
<ol data-start="191" data-end="742">
<li data-start="191" data-end="252">
<p data-start="194" data-end="252"><strong data-start="194" data-end="202">Hero</strong> (full‑width background, headline, subtext, CTA)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="253" data-end="310">
<p data-start="256" data-end="310"><strong data-start="256" data-end="268">Services</strong> (4‑card grid with icon, title, benefit)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="311" data-end="375">
<p data-start="314" data-end="375"><strong data-start="314" data-end="327">Portfolio</strong> (carousel or responsive grid of 6–8 projects)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="376" data-end="423">
<p data-start="379" data-end="423"><strong data-start="379" data-end="388">About</strong> (bio, headshot, client‑logo bar)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="424" data-end="506">
<p data-start="427" data-end="506"><strong data-start="427" data-end="438">Process</strong> (4‑step horizontal graphic: Discover → Design → Develop → Deploy)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="507" data-end="570">
<p data-start="510" data-end="570"><strong data-start="510" data-end="526">Testimonials</strong> (rotating quotes with optional headshots)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="571" data-end="640">
<p data-start="574" data-end="640"><strong data-start="574" data-end="594">Pricing Snapshot</strong> (3‑column feature table, “View Plans” link)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="641" data-end="690">
<p data-start="644" data-end="690"><strong data-start="644" data-end="655">Contact</strong> (short form + embedded Calendly)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="691" data-end="742">
<p data-start="694" data-end="742"><strong data-start="694" data-end="704">Footer</strong> (mini‑nav, social icons, legal links)</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="744" data-end="848">Each section sits in its own <code data-start="773" data-end="784">&lt;section&gt;</code> with consistent padding and grid-based layout (e.g. 12‑column).</p>
<hr data-start="850" data-end="853">
<h2 data-start="855" data-end="901">2. Annotated HTML/CSS Snippets for SiteSwan</h2>
