<h2 data-start="3153" data-end="3191">3. Content Outline &amp; Suggested Copy</h2>
<div class="_tableContainer_16hzy_1"><div tabindex="-1" class="_tableWrapper_16hzy_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse"><table data-start="3193" data-end="4730" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="3193" data-end="3325"><tr data-start="3193" data-end="3325"><th data-start="3193" data-end="3213" data-col-size="sm">Section</th><th data-start="3213" data-end="3262" data-col-size="sm">Heading</th><th data-start="3262" data-end="3325" data-col-size="md">Subtext / Bullets</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="3459" data-end="4730"><tr data-start="3459" data-end="3610"><td data-start="3459" data-end="3479" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="3461" data-end="3469">Hero</strong></td><td data-start="3479" data-end="3528" data-col-size="sm">Build Your Digital Home with Confidence</td><td data-start="3528" data-end="3610" data-col-size="md">“Your partner for custom websites, e‑commerce solutions, and managed hosting.”</td></tr><tr data-start="3611" data-end="3768"><td data-start="3611" data-end="3631" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="3613" data-end="3625">Services</strong></td><td data-start="3631" data-end="3680" data-col-size="sm">What We Do</td><td data-start="3680" data-end="3768" data-col-size="md">- Custom Web Design<br>- E‑commerce Solutions<br>- Managed Hosting<br>- 24/7 Support</td></tr><tr data-start="3769" data-end="3906"><td data-start="3769" data-end="3789" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="3771" data-end="3784">Portfolio</strong></td><td data-start="3789" data-end="3838" data-col-size="sm">Our Work</td><td data-start="3838" data-end="3906" data-col-size="md">“A showcase of recent projects. Click any to view case studies.”</td></tr><tr data-start="3907" data-end="4046"><td data-start="3907" data-end="3927" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="3909" data-end="3918">About</strong></td><td data-start="3927" data-end="3976" data-col-size="sm">Meet the Team</td><td data-start="3976" data-end="4046" data-col-size="md">Brief bio of Damien Townsend + years of experience + partner logos</td></tr><tr data-start="4047" data-end="4180"><td data-start="4047" data-end="4067" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="4049" data-end="4060">Process</strong></td><td data-start="4067" data-end="4116" data-col-size="sm">How We Work</td><td data-start="4116" data-end="4180" data-col-size="md">1. Discover → 2. Design → 3. Develop → 4. Deploy</td></tr><tr data-start="4181" data-end="4314"><td data-start="4181" data-end="4201" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="4183" data-end="4199">Testimonials</strong></td><td data-start="4201" data-end="4250" data-col-size="sm">What Our Clients Say</td><td data-start="4250" data-end="4314" data-col-size="md">Rotating quotes from 3–5 past clients, with names &amp; photos</td></tr><tr data-start="4315" data-end="4456"><td data-start="4315" data-end="4335" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="4317" data-end="4328">Pricing</strong></td><td data-start="4335" data-end="4384" data-col-size="sm">Hosting Plans</td><td data-start="4384" data-end="4456" data-col-size="md">- Basic: starting at $29/mo<br>- Pro: $59/mo<br>- Premium: $99/mo</td></tr><tr data-start="4457" data-end="4596"><td data-start="4457" data-end="4477" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="4459" data-end="4470">Contact</strong></td><td data-start="4477" data-end="4526" data-col-size="sm">Ready to Get Started?</td><td data-start="4526" data-end="4596" data-col-size="md">Form fields: Name, Email, Company, Project Details + “Book a Call”</td></tr><tr data-start="4597" data-end="4730"><td data-start="4597" data-end="4617" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="4599" data-end="4609">Footer</strong></td><td data-start="4617" data-end="4666" data-col-size="sm">Trust &amp; Connect</td><td data-start="4666" data-end="4730" data-col-size="md">Social icons + Privacy Policy + Terms of Service</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky end-(--thread-content-margin) h-0 self-end select-none"><div class="absolute end-0 flex 