</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="1899" data-end="1902">
<h2 data-start="1904" data-end="1922">4. Accent Usage</h2>
<ul data-start="1924" data-end="2229">
<li data-start="1924" data-end="2028">
<p data-start="1926" data-end="2028"><strong data-start="1926" data-end="1944">Buttons &amp; CTAs</strong>: Use <code data-start="1950" data-end="1984">background: var(--gradient-gold)</code> to tie back to your logo’s metallic feel.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2029" data-end="2131">
<p data-start="2031" data-end="2131"><strong data-start="2031" data-end="2047">Hover states</strong>: Lighten or darken the gold with CSS filters or alternate stops in your gradient.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2132" data-end="2229">
<p data-start="2134" data-end="2229"><strong data-start="2134" data-end="2154">Section headings</strong>: A thin underline or icon in solid <code data-start="2190" data-end="2204">--color-gold</code> directly beneath <code data-start="2222" data-end="2228">&lt;h2&gt;</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="2231" data-end="2234">
<p data-start="2236" data-end="2399" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">With these tweaks, your site will feel cohesive and on‑brand. Let me know if you’d like me to plug this into our existing snippets or adjust sizing/colors further!</p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-selected="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="touch:w-10 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611 3.16504 10.667V13.5C3.16504 14.211 3.16593 14.7044