</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
</li>
<li data-start="444" data-end="516">
<p data-start="447" data-end="516">Make sure you can see your files on GitHub under the <strong data-start="500" data-end="508">main</strong> branch.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="518" data-end="521">
<h2 data-start="523" data-end="557">2. Connect your repo in Netlify</h2>
<ol data-start="559" data-end="921">
<li data-start="559" data-end="600">
<p data-start="562" data-end="600"><strong data-start="562" data-end="572">Log in</strong> at <a data-start="576" data-end="599" rel="noopener" target="_new" class="cursor-pointer">https://app.netlify.com</a>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="601" data-end="652">
<p data-start="604" data-end="652">Click <strong data-start="610" data-end="633">“New site from Git”</strong> on your dashboard.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="653" data-end="745">
<p data-start="656" data-end="745">Choose your Git provider (GitHub/GitLab/Bitbucket) and <strong data-start="711" data-end="724">authorize</strong> Netlify if prompted.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="746" data-end="787">
<p data-start="749" data-end="787">Select the repository you just pushed.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="788" data-end="893">
<p data-start="791" data-end="893"><strong data-start="791" data-end="812">Branch to deploy:</strong> <code data-start="813" data-end="819">main</code><br data-start="819" data-end="822">
<strong data-start="825" data-end="843">Build command:</strong> <em data-start="844" data-end="859">(leave blank)</em><br data-start="859" data-end="862">
<strong data-start="865" data-end="887">Publish directory:</strong> <code data-start="888" data-end="891">.</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="894" data-end="921">
<p data-start="897" data-end="921">Click <strong data-start="903" data-end="920">“Deploy site”</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="923" data-end="940">Netlify will now:</p>
<ul data-start="941" data-end="1114">
<li data-start="941" data-end="970">
<p data-start="943" data-end="970">Pull your code from GitHub.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="971" data-end="1021">
<p data-start="973" data-end="1021">Build (there’s nothing to build—plain HTML/CSS).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1022" data-end="1045">
<p data-start="1024" data-end="1045">Deploy to a live URL.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1046" data-end="1114">
<p data-start="1048" data-end="1114"><strong data-start="1048" data-end="1065">Automatically</strong> redeploy on every future <code data-start="1091" data-end="1101">git push</code> to <strong data-start="1105" data-end="1113">main</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1116" data-end="1119">
<h2 data-start="1121" data-end="1145">3. Verify &amp; Customize</h2>
<ul data-start="1147" data-end="1387">
<li data-start="1147" data-end="1211">
<p data-start="1149" data-end="1211">Once deployed, you’ll see a <strong data-start="1177" data-end="1190">live link</strong>. Open it to confirm.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1212" data-end="1289">
<p data-start="1214" data-end="1289">Netlify will rebuild/deploy every time you push to <code data-start="1265" data-end="1271">main</code>—zero extra steps!</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1290" data-end="1387">
<p data-start="1292" data-end="1387">If you ever need redirects or custom headers, add them to <code data-start="1350" data-end="1364">netlify.toml</code> in your repo and push.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1389" data-end="1392">
<p data-start="1394" data-end="1523" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">That’s all there is to it—no extra configuration or scripts required. Give those steps a try and let me know where you get stuck!</p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-selected="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="touch:w-10 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611 3.16504 10.667V13.5C3.16504 14.211 3.16593 14.7044 3.19727 15.0879C3.22797 15.4636 3