<hr data-start="58" data-end="61">
<h2 data-start="63" data-end="116">1. Make sure your branch actually exists on GitHub</h2>
<ol data-start="118" data-end="505">
<li data-start="118" data-end="242">
<p data-start="121" data-end="242"><strong data-start="121" data-end="150">Go to your repo on GitHub</strong> and confirm you have at least one commit on a branch, usually named <code data-start="219" data-end="225">main</code> (or <code data-start="230" data-end="238">master</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="243" data-end="417">
