netlify init
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<ul data-start="1374" data-end="1493">
<li data-start="1374" data-end="1439">
<p data-start="1376" data-end="1439">Choose <strong data-start="1383" data-end="1409">“Use an existing site”</strong> and pick the one you created.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1443" data-end="1493">
<p data-start="1445" data-end="1493">When it asks for the deploy branch, type <code data-start="1486" data-end="1492">main</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="1494" data-end="1680">
<p data-start="1497" data-end="1530">Push your first production build:</p>
