</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1585" data-end="1680">From then on, pushing to <code data-start="1610" data-end="1616">main</code> and running <code data-start="1629" data-end="1652">netlify deploy --prod</code> will update your live site.</p>
</li>
</ol>
