gap-2 overflow-x-clip" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><div class="relative w-full text-start"><div class="flex w-full flex-col items-start justify-between text-start"><button class="flex w-full items-center gap-0.5"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 text-start align-middle text-token-text-secondary hover:text-token-text-primary" style="opacity: 1;">Thought for a couple of seconds</span><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-sm text-token-text-secondary inline align-middle transition-transform"><path d="M7.52925 3.7793C7.75652 3.55203 8.10803 3.52383 8.36616 3.69434L8.47065 3.7793L14.2207 9.5293C14.4804 9.789 14.4804 10.211 14.2207 10.4707L8.47065 16.2207C8.21095 16.4804 7.78895 16.4804 7.52925 16.2207C7.26955 15.961 7.26955 15.539 7.52925 15.2793L12.8085 10L7.52925 4.7207L7.44429 4.61621C7.27378 4.35808 7.30198 4.00657 7.52925 3.7793Z"></path></svg></button></div></div></span></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="1b7d147f-2dbf-4125-80ce-f24e6649a2b0" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5" data-message-model-slug="o4-mini-high"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light"><p data-start="0" data-end="80">That link takes you right into the “Link repository” step—let’s walk through it:</p>
<ol data-start="82" data-end="986">
<li data-start="82" data-end="433">
<p data-start="85" data-end="122"><strong data-start="85" data-end="120">Re‑authorize GitHub (if needed)</strong></p>
<ul data-start="126" data-end="433">
<li data-start="126" data-end="236">
<p data-start="128" data-end="236">In the bottom left of that Netlify panel, click <strong data-start="176" data-end="205">“Refresh repository list”</strong> (or “Reconnect repository”).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="240" data-end="433">
<p data-start="242" data-end="433">If that still doesn’t pull in branches, go up to <strong data-start="291" data-end="360">User Settings → Applications → Git provider → Refresh permissions</strong> to make sure Netlify has access to your dtownsend513/dtownsend513 repo.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="435" data-end="579">
<p data-start="438" data-end="460"><strong data-start="438" data-end="458">Select your repo</strong></p>
<ul data-start="464" data-end="579">
<li data-start="464" data-end="579">
<p data-start="466" data-end="579">Back on the “Link repository” page, you should now see dtownsend513/dtownsend513 in the list. Click to select it.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="581" data-end="816">
<p data-start="584" data-end="616"><strong data-start="584" data-end="614">Manually enter your branch</strong></p>
<ul data-start="620" data-end="816">
<li data-start="620" data-end="816">
<p data-start="622" data-end="816">Under <strong data-start="628" data-end="648">Branch to deploy</strong>, click into the blank dropdown and type <code data-start="689" data-end="695">main</code> (or <code data-start="700" data-end="708">master</code> if that’s your branch name), then press Enter. Netlify will accept the text even if it doesn’t show a list.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="818" data-end="986">
<p data-start="821" data-end="840"><strong data-start="821" data-end="838">Save &amp; Deploy</strong></p>
<ul data-start="844" data-end="986">
<li data-start="844" data-end="904">
<p data-start="846" data-end="904">Scroll down and click <strong data-start="868" data-end="878">“Save”</strong> (or “Link repository”).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="908" data-end="986">
<p data-start="910" data-end="986">Netlify will immediately start a deploy of whatever’s on your <code data-start="972" data-end="978">main</code> branch.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="988" data-end="991">
<p data-start="993" data-end="1031"><strong data-start="993" data-end="1029">If it still won’t accept <code data-start="1020" data-end="1026">main</code>:</strong></p>
<ul data-start="1033" data-end="1218">
<li data-start="1033" data-end="1162">
<p data-start="1035" data-end="1084">Confirm locally that you really pushed to <code data-start="1077" data-end="1083">main</code>:</p>
