</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1405" data-end="1527">(or <code data-start="1409" data-end="1417">master</code> if that’s the name you see on GitHub) and <strong data-start="1460" data-end="1475">press Enter</strong>. Netlify will accept it even if it doesn’t list it.</p>
<hr data-start="1529" data-end="1532">
<h3 data-start="1534" data-end="1577">5. Alternate: Link &amp; deploy via the CLI</h3>
<p data-start="1579" data-end="1631">If the UI keeps balking, you can bypass it entirely:</p>
