</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="366" data-end="423">This will open your browser so you can authorize the CLI.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="425" data-end="721">
<p data-start="428" data-end="486"><strong data-start="428" data-end="484">Link your local folder to your existing Netlify site</strong></p>
