netlify init
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<ul data-start="548" data-end="721">
<li data-start="548" data-end="601">
<p data-start="550" data-end="601">When prompted, choose <strong data-start="572" data-end="598">“Use an existing site”</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="605" data-end="647">
<p data-start="607" data-end="647">Pick your Townsend site from the list.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="651" data-end="721">
<p data-start="653" data-end="721">When it asks for the deploy branch, <strong data-start="689" data-end="697">type</strong> <code data-start="698" data-end="704">main</code> and press Enter.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="723" data-end="871">
<p data-start="726" data-end="763"><strong data-start="726" data-end="761">Do an initial production deploy</strong></p>
