<p data-start="818" data-end="871">This pushes your current <code data-start="843" data-end="849">main</code> → Netlify production.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="873" data-end="876">
<p data-start="878" data-end="893">🎉 From now on:</p>
<ul data-start="895" data-end="1038">
<li data-start="895" data-end="931">
<p data-start="897" data-end="931"><strong data-start="897" data-end="906">Every</strong> <code data-start="907" data-end="929">git push origin main</code></p>
