</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<ul data-start="785" data-end="1010">
<li data-start="785" data-end="822">
<p data-start="787" data-end="822">Choose <strong data-start="794" data-end="820">“Use an existing site”</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="826" data-end="855">
<p data-start="828" data-end="855">Select your Townsend site</p>
</li>
<li data-start="859" data-end="943">
<p data-start="861" data-end="943">When asked “Which folder do you want to deploy?”, just press Enter to accept <code data-start="938" data-end="941">.</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="947" data-end="1010">
<p data-start="949" data-end="1010">When asked for the deploy branch, type <code data-start="988" data-end="994">main</code> and press Enter</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="1012" data-end="1093">
<p data-start="1015" data-end="1042"><strong data-start="1015" data-end="1041">Push your first deploy</strong>:</p>
