<hr data-start="921" data-end="924">
<h2 data-start="926" data-end="962">Option 2: Download ZIP &amp; skip Git</h2>
<ol data-start="964" data-end="1615">
<li data-start="964" data-end="1136">
<p data-start="967" data-end="1005"><strong data-start="967" data-end="1003">Download the repository as a ZIP</strong></p>
<ul data-start="1009" data-end="1136">
<li data-start="1009" data-end="1079">
<p data-start="1011" data-end="1079">Go in your browser to <a data-start="1033" data-end="1077" rel="noopener" target="_new" class="" href="https://github.com/dtownsend513/dtownsend513">https://github.com/dtownsend513/dtownsend513</a></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1083" data-end="1136">
<p data-start="1085" data-end="1136">Click the green <strong data-start="1101" data-end="1109">Code</strong> button → <strong data-start="1119" data-end="1135">Download ZIP</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="1138" data-end="1325">
<p data-start="1141" data-end="1157"><strong data-start="1141" data-end="1155">Extract it</strong></p>
<ul data-start="1161" data-end="1325">
<li data-start="1161" data-end="1234">
<p data-start="1163" data-end="1234">Right‑click the downloaded <code data-start="1190" data-end="1213">dtownsend513-main.zip</code> → <strong data-start="1216" data-end="1232">Extract All…</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1238" data-end="1325">
<p data-start="1240" data-end="1325">Note the folder it creates, e.g. <code data-start="1273" data-end="1325">C:\Users\Administrator\Downloads\dtownsend513-main</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
