</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1087" data-end="1114">will update your live site.</p>
<hr data-start="1116" data-end="1119">
<h3 data-start="1121" data-end="1163">If you really need <code data-start="1144" data-end="1149">git</code> in PowerShell</h3>
<ol data-start="1165" data-end="1487">
<li data-start="1165" data-end="1239">
<p data-start="1168" data-end="1239">Open <strong data-start="1173" data-end="1194">System Properties</strong> → <strong data-start="1197" data-end="1209">Advanced</strong> → <strong data-start="1212" data-end="1237">Environment Variables</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1240" data-end="1307">
<p data-start="1243" data-end="1307">Under <strong data-start="1249" data-end="1269">System Variables</strong>, find <strong data-start="1276" data-end="1284">Path</strong> → <strong data-start="1287" data-end="1295">Edit</strong> → <strong data-start="1298" data-end="1305">New</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1308" data-end="1398">
<p data-start="1311" data-end="1317">Paste:</p>
