</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="247" data-end="355">Type <strong data-start="252" data-end="257">Y</strong> and <strong data-start="262" data-end="271">Enter</strong>. That will scaffold a <code data-start="294" data-end="308">netlify.toml</code> for you (publish = <code data-start="328" data-end="331">.</code> with no build command).</p>
<p data-start="357" data-end="457">After that, you should see confirmation that the directory and branch (<code data-start="428" data-end="434">main</code>) are set. Finally run:</p>
