  </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">publish</span></span><span> = </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"."</span></span><span>   </span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># deploy everything in the current directory</span></span><span>
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="524" data-end="584"><em data-start="524" data-end="532">Remove</em> any <code data-start="537" data-end="569">command = "# no build command"</code> line entirely.</p>
<hr data-start="586" data-end="589">
<h3 data-start="591" data-end="625">3. Save the file and re‑deploy</h3>
<p data-start="627" data-end="687">In Git Bash (or your terminal while in that project folder):</p>
