nded-full"></div></div><div class="relative my-1 min-h-6"><div class="relative flex max-w-[calc(0.8*var(--thread-content-max-width,40rem))] origin-top-left flex-col gap-2 overflow-x-clip" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><div class="relative w-full text-start"><div class="flex w-full flex-col items-start justify-between text-start"><button class="flex w-full items-center gap-0.5"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 text-start align-middle text-token-text-secondary hover:text-token-text-primary" style="opacity: 1;">Thought for 9 seconds</span><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-sm text-token-text-secondary inline align-middle transition-transform"><path d="M7.52925 3.7793C7.75652 3.55203 8.10803 3.52383 8.36616 3.69434L8.47065 3.7793L14.2207 9.5293C14.4804 9.789 14.4804 10.211 14.2207 10.4707L8.47065 16.2207C8.21095 16.4804 7.78895 16.4804 7.52925 16.2207C7.26955 15.961 7.26955 15.539 7.52925 15.2793L12.8085 10L7.52925 4.7207L7.44429 4.61621C7.27378 4.35808 7.30198 4.00657 7.52925 3.7793Z"></path></svg></button></div></div></span></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="919b41be-2f32-47c5-a1cd-f639bf8600c2" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5" data-message-model-slug="o4-mini-high"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light"><p data-start="0" data-end="114">Let’s simplify and switch to the <strong data-start="33" data-end="48">interactive</strong> link + manual deploy flow—this avoids all the flag‑naming issues:</p>
<hr data-start="116" data-end="119">
<h3 data-start="121" data-end="153">1. Clean up any stray config</h3>
<p data-start="155" data-end="224">In your project root (<code data-start="177" data-end="214">C:\Users\Administrator\dtownsend513</code>), delete:</p>
<ul data-start="226" data-end="280">
<li data-start="226" data-end="252">
<p data-start="228" data-end="252">Any <code data-start="232" data-end="243">.netlify/</code> folder</p>
</li>
<li data-start="253" data-end="280">
<p data-start="255" data-end="280">Any <code data-start="259" data-end="273">netlify.toml</code> file</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="282" data-end="330">This ensures Netlify CLI picks up a clean slate.</p>
<hr data-start="332" data-end="335">
<h3 data-start="337" data-end="375">2. Log in (if you haven’t already)</h3>
