31 15.3408L9.2168 15.2305C9.36965 15.1046 9.55583 14.9207 9.90527 14.5713L14.8926 9.58301L11.666 6.35742L6.67871 11.3447ZM16.1963 5.05371C15.3054 4.16304 13.8616 4.16305 12.9707 5.05371L12.6074 5.41602L15.833 8.64258L16.1963 8.2793C17.0869 7.38845 17.0869 5.94456 16.1963 5.05371Z"></path><path d="M4.58301 1.7832C4.72589 1.7832 4.84877 1.88437 4.87695 2.02441C4.99384 2.60873 5.22432 3.11642 5.58398 3.50391C5.94115 3.88854 6.44253 4.172 7.13281 4.28711C7.27713 4.3114 7.38267 4.43665 7.38281 4.58301C7.38281 4.7295 7.27723 4.8546 7.13281 4.87891C6.44249 4.99401 5.94116 5.27746 5.58398 5.66211C5.26908 6.00126 5.05404 6.43267 4.92676 6.92676L4.87695 7.1416C4.84891 7.28183 4.72601 7.38281 4.58301 7.38281C4.44013 7.38267 4.31709 7.28173 4.28906 7.1416C4.17212 6.55728 3.94179 6.04956 3.58203 5.66211C3.22483 5.27757 2.72347 4.99395 2.0332 4.87891C1.88897 4.85446 1.7832 4.72938 1.7832 4.58301C1.78335 4.43673 1.88902 4.3115 2.0332 4.28711C2.72366 4.17203 3.22481 3.88861 3.58203 3.50391C3.94186 3.11638 4.17214 2.60888 4.28906 2.02441L4.30371 1.97363C4.34801 1.86052 4.45804 1.78333 4.58301 1.7832Z"></path></svg>Edit</button></span></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-auto p-4" dir="ltr"><code class="whitespace-pre! language-powershell"><span>netlify link
</span></code></div></div></pre>
<ul data-start="545" data-end="912">
<li data-start="545" data-end="658">
<p data-start="547" data-end="658">When prompted <strong data-start="561" data-end="595">“? What would you like to do?”</strong>, select <strong data-start="604" data-end="637">“Connect to an existing site”</strong> and hit <strong data-start="646" data-end="655">Enter</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="659" data-end="812">
<p data-start="661" data-end="812">You’ll then see a list of your Netlify sites—use the arrow keys to highlight your Townsend site (e.g. “same‑k9b4q7zbb4s‑latest”) and press <strong data-start="800" data-end="809">Enter</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="813" data-end="912">
<p data-start="815" data-end="912">When it asks <strong data-start="828" data-end="873">“? What folder would you like to deploy?”</strong>, just press <strong data-start="886" data-end="895">Enter</strong> to accept <code data-start="906" data-end="909">.</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="914" data-end="980">That will create the necessary <code data-start="945" data-end="955">.netlify</code> metadata in your folder.</p>
<hr data-start="982" data-end="985">
<h3 data-start="987" data-end="1014">4. Deploy to production</h3>
<p data-start="1016" data-end="1068">Still in <code data-start="1025" data-end="1062">C:\Users\Administrator\dtownsend513</code>, run:</p>
