</span></code></div></div></pre>
<ul data-start="1119" data-end="1272">
<li data-start="1119" data-end="1214">
<p data-start="1121" data-end="1214"><strong data-start="1121" data-end="1133"><code data-start="1123" data-end="1131">--prod</code></strong> tells Netlify you want to update your live site (rather than a draft preview).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1215" data-end="1272">
<p data-start="1217" data-end="1272"><strong data-start="1217" data-end="1230"><code data-start="1219" data-end="1228">--dir .</code></strong> says “publish everything in this folder.”</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1274" data-end="1337">You should see a “Deploy succeeded!” message and your live URL.</p>
<hr data-start="1339" data-end="1342">
<h3 data-start="1344" data-end="1365">5. Future updates</h3>
<p data-start="1367" data-end="1399">Any time you change files, just:</p>
