git commit -m </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"Your message"</span></span><span>
git push origin main
netlify deploy --prod --</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">dir</span></span><span> .
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1504" data-end="1554">—no more fiddling with build commands or site IDs.</p>
<hr data-start="1556" data-end="1559">
<p data-start="1561" data-end="1720">Give that a try. If at the end of <strong data-start="1595" data-end="1605">step 3</strong> you don’t see your Townsend site in the list, let me know exactly what options appear and we’ll adjust from there!</p>
