  </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">command</span></span><span> = </span><span><span class="hljs-string">""</span></span><span>
  </span><span><span class="hljs-comment"># publish everything in this folder</span></span><span>
  </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">publish</span></span><span> = </span><span><span class="hljs-string">"."</span></span><span>
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="414" data-end="452">You can do it in PowerShell like this:</p>
