[build]
  command = ""
  publish = "."
"@
</span></code></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="556" data-end="559">
<h3 data-start="561" data-end="576">2) Redeploy</h3>
<p data-start="578" data-end="660">Since you’ve already run <code data-start="603" data-end="617">netlify link</code>, just trigger the production deploy again:</p>
