0rem))] origin-top-left flex-col gap-2 overflow-x-clip" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><div class="relative w-full text-start"><div class="flex w-full flex-col items-start justify-between text-start"><button class="flex w-full items-center gap-0.5"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 text-start align-middle text-token-text-secondary hover:text-token-text-primary" style="opacity: 1;">Thought for 13 seconds</span><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-sm text-token-text-secondary inline align-middle transition-transform"><path d="M7.52925 3.7793C7.75652 3.55203 8.10803 3.52383 8.36616 3.69434L8.47065 3.7793L14.2207 9.5293C14.4804 9.789 14.4804 10.211 14.2207 10.4707L8.47065 16.2207C8.21095 16.4804 7.78895 16.4804 7.52925 16.2207C7.26955 15.961 7.26955 15.539 7.52925 15.2793L12.8085 10L7.52925 4.7207L7.44429 4.61621C7.27378 4.35808 7.30198 4.00657 7.52925 3.7793Z"></path></svg></button></div></div></span></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="12b10796-42ef-45bb-8043-477166731647" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5" data-message-model-slug="o4-mini-high"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light"><p data-start="0" data-end="198">You’re almost there — Git is refusing to let you commit because you haven’t told it who “you” are, and it can’t push your work because there’s no local <strong data-start="152" data-end="160">main</strong> branch yet. Let’s fix both in one go:</p>
<ol data-start="200" data-end="853">
<li data-start="200" data-end="402">
