class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light"><p data-start="0" data-end="74">Perfect—your <code data-start="13" data-end="19">main</code> branch is now live on GitHub and tracking origin. 🎉</p>
<p data-start="76" data-end="200">From here on out, every time you push to <code data-start="117" data-end="123">main</code>, Netlify will automatically rebuild and deploy your site for you. To verify:</p>
<ol data-start="202" data-end="494">
<li data-start="202" data-end="397">
<p data-start="205" data-end="228"><strong data-start="205" data-end="226">Watch the Deploys</strong></p>
<ul data-start="232" data-end="397">
<li data-start="232" data-end="310">
<p data-start="234" data-end="310">Go to <strong data-start="240" data-end="308"><a data-start="242" data-end="306" rel="noopener" target="_new" class="" href="https://app.netlify.com/projects/same-k9b4q7zbb4s-latest/deploys">https://app.netlify.com/projects/same-k9b4q7zbb4s-latest/deploys</a></strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="314" data-end="397">
<p data-start="316" data-end="397">You should see a new deploy entry with “Incoming build from main” and its status.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="399" data-end="494">
<p data-start="402" data-end="428"><strong data-start="402" data-end="426">Check your live site</strong></p>
<ul data-start="432" data-end="494">
<li data-start="432" data-end="494">
<p data-start="434" data-end="494">Visit <strong data-start="440" data-end="466"><a data-start="442" data-end="464" rel="noopener" target="_new" class="" href="https://townsendsq.com/">https://townsendsq.com</a></strong> to see your latest changes.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="496" data-end="499">
<h3 data-start="501" data-end="525">Quick Workflow Recap</h3>
<ol data-start="527" data-end="827">
<li data-start="527" data-end="593">
<p data-start="530" data-end="593">Make edits locally (e.g. tweak <code data-start="561" data-end="573">index.html</code> or <code data-start="577" data-end="589">styles.css</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="594" data-end="704">
<p data-start="597" data-end="620">In your project folder:</p>
