7168C5.45942 4.53222 3.65314 6.72647 3.40527 9.375H6.63672C6.69362 7.56102 6.99415 5.90775 7.4707 4.65137C7.59781 4.31629 7.74073 4.00224 7.89844 3.7168Z"></path></svg><div class="text-token-text-secondary mt-[-1px] text-[13px] font-medium">Sources</div></button></div></div></div></div></article><article class="text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none scroll-mt-(--header-height)" tabindex="-1" dir="auto" data-testid="conversation-turn-57" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="user" style="scroll-margin-top: -2488px;"><h5 class="sr-only">You said:</h5><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto pt-12 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @[37rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @[72rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:32rem] @[34rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @[64rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col" tabindex="-1"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col grow"><div data-message-author-role="user" data-message-id="ce684d1c-2ff1-45a6-bb6f-5999819c6bc4" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden items-end rtl:items-start"><div class="user-message-bubble-color relative max-w-[var(--user-chat-width,70%)] rounded-[18px] px-4 py-1.5 data-[multiline]:py-3" data-multiline=""><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap">“I’d like you to act as an expert web developer and designer who specializes in building polished, conversion‑focused portfolio sites on the SiteSwan platform. My goal is to have a single‑page (with smooth scroll navigation) site that highlights my web design services and monthly hosting packages, persuades prospects to book a call, and demonstrates my technical proficiency with SiteSwan.

Here’s all the context we need:

Brand &amp; Audience

I’m “Damien Townsend,” founder of Townsend &amp; Townsend.

Target clients: small businesses. (ages 30–55).

Key pain points: outdated websites, confusing hosting, hidden fees.

Visual Style &amp; Tone

Modern, clean, white‑space‑driven layout.

Accent color: #FF6B00 (bright orange), secondary #333 (dark gray).

Sans‑serif fonts (e.g. Inter or Helvetica Neue).

Friendly but professional voice: “we” statements, benefit‑first headlines.

Structure &amp; Sections

Hero: Full‑width banner with your logo on left, “Transform Your Online Presence” headline, 2‑line subheading, and a CTA button “Get Your Free Quote” that scrolls to the contact form.

Services Overview: Three icon‑driven cards for “Custom Web Design,” “Responsive e‑Commerce,” “Managed Hosting &amp; Maintenance,” each with a 2–3 sentence benefit summary.

Portfolio Carousel: A horizontal scroll of 4 recent projects (thumbnail + hover overlay with project name + “View Case Study” link).

Hosting Plans: A pricing table comparing “Basic,” “Premium,” and “Enterprise” monthly plans—list features (disk space, bandwidth, SSL, backups, support hours) and prices ($50, $100/mo).

About Me: A two‑column section with a headshot on left and a short bio on right (“10+ years building sites, 200+ happy clients…”).

Testimonials: Slider of 3 quotes from previous clients with star ratings.

Process: A 4‑step graphic (Discover → Design → Develop → Deploy) with icons and one‑sentence descriptions.

Contact Form: Name, email, phone, project details field, checkbox to subscribe to newsletter, and a “Send Message” button.

Footer: Social links (LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram), copyright, small nav.

Functionality &amp; Integrations

SiteSwan custom HTML blocks only where needed (for the pricing table and carousel).

Embed Calendly widget under the Contact Form as a secondary way to book a call.

Ensure the site is fully responsive on desktop, tablet, and mobile.

Add basic SEO meta tags (title, description, Open Graph image).

Lazy‑load portfolio images for performance.

Include a privacy‑compliant cookie banner.

Deliverables

Complete HTML/CSS (and any minimal JS) that’s copy‑pasted into SiteSwan’s custom blocks.

Step‑by‑step instructions on where each block goes in the SiteSwan editor.

A list of all images/icons to source (with placeholder wireframes).

Short tutorial on how to update text, swap in new portfolio items, and adjust hosting prices.

Please produce:

A detailed SiteSwan page blueprint (section by section).

The actual code snippets for custom HTML/CSS blocks.

A sample of written copy for each section.

Guidance on picking fonts and stock‑photo styles that match my brand.

That level of detail will ensure I get a ready‑to‑paste, on‑brand, high‑converting SiteSwan site for showcasing my web design and hosting business.”

Use that exact prompt when talking to me as ChatGPT and you’ll get a turnkey SiteSwan build plan plus all the code, copy, and configuration steps you need.</div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex justify-end"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none duration-300 group-hover/turn-messages:delay-300 pointer-events-none opacity-0 motion-safe:transition-opacity group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:opacity-100 group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:opacity-100 has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:opacity-100" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-selected="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="touch:w-10 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611 3.16504 10.667V13.5C3.16504 14.211 3.16593 14.7044 3.19727 15.0879C3.22797 15.4636 3.28473 15.675 3.36524 15.833L3.43555 15.959C3.61186 16.2466 3.86474 16.4807 4.16699 16.6348L4.29688 16.6914C4.44063 16.7428 4.63025 16.7797 4.91211 16.8027C5.29563 16.8341 5.78896 16.835 6.5 16.835H9.33301C10.0439 16.835 10.5374 16.8341 