<hr data-start="235" data-end="238">
<h2 data-start="240" data-end="284">🗺️ 1. Page Blueprint (SiteSwan Sections)</h2>
<ol data-start="286" data-end="563">
<li data-start="286" data-end="308">
<p data-start="289" data-end="308"><strong data-start="289" data-end="308">Navbar (Global)</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="309" data-end="322">
<p data-start="312" data-end="322"><strong data-start="312" data-end="320">Hero</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="323" data-end="349">
<p data-start="326" data-end="349"><strong data-start="326" data-end="347">Services Overview</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="350" data-end="377">
<p data-start="353" data-end="377"><strong data-start="353" data-end="375">Portfolio Carousel</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="378" data-end="400">
<p data-start="381" data-end="400"><strong data-start="381" data-end="398">Hosting Plans</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="401" data-end="418">
<p data-start="404" data-end="418"><strong data-start="404" data-end="416">About Me</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="419" data-end="441">
<p data-start="422" data-end="441"><strong data-start="422" data-end="439">Process Steps</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="442" data-end="470">
<p data-start="445" data-end="470"><strong data-start="445" data-end="468">Testimonials Slider</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="471" data-end="498">
<p data-start="474" data-end="498"><strong data-start="474" data-end="496">Contact &amp; Calendly</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="499" data-end="522">
<p data-start="503" data-end="522"><strong data-start="503" data-end="520">Cookie Banner</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="523" data-end="539">
<p data-start="527" data-end="539"><strong data-start="527" data-end="537">Footer</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="540" data-end="563">
<p data-start="544" data-end="563"><strong data-start="544" data-end="563">SEO + Meta Tags</strong></p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="565" data-end="712">Each of these is a Section in SiteSwan; you’ll drag in a “Custom HTML” block for any code below, or use built‑in text/image blocks for simple copy.</p>
<hr data-start="714" data-end="717">
<h2 data-start="719" data-end="740">🔧 2. Global Setup</h2>
<h3 data-start="742" data-end="768">2.1. SiteSwan Settings</h3>
<ul data-start="770" data-end="1946">
<li data-start="770" data-end="1592">
<p data-start="772" data-end="836"><strong data-start="772" data-end="781">Fonts</strong>: In your global Styles, import Inter &amp; Helvetica Neue:</p>
