</span><span><span class="hljs-comment">/* Helvetica Neue you’ll need to self‑host or choose “System UI, Helvetica Neue, Arial, sans-serif” */</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-selector-pseudo">:root</span></span><span> {
  </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">--ff-heading</span></span><span>: </span><span><span class="hljs-string">'Inter'</span></span><span>, sans-serif;
  </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">--ff-body</span></span><span>: system-ui, </span><span><span class="hljs-string">'Helvetica Neue'</span></span><span>, Arial, sans-serif;
  </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">--clr-accent</span></span><span>: </span><span><span class="hljs-number">#FF6B00</span></span><span>;
  </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">--clr-dark</span></span><span>: </span><span><span class="hljs-number">#333333</span></span><span>;
  </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">--clr-light</span></span><span>: </span><span><span class="hljs-number">#FFFFFF</span></span><span>;
}
</span><span><span class="hljs-selector-tag">body</span></span><span> { </span><span><span class="hljs-attribute">font-family</span></span><span>: </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">var</span></span><span>(--ff-body); </span><span><span class="hljs-attribute">color</span></span><span>: </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">var</span></span><span>(--clr-dark); }
</span><span><span class="hljs-selector-tag">h1</span></span><span>,</span><span><span class="hljs-selector-tag">h2</span></span><span>,</span><span><span class="hljs-selector-tag">h3</span></span><span>,</span><span><span class="hljs-selector-tag">h4</span></span><span> { </span><span><span class="hljs-attribute">font-family</span></span><span>: </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">var</span></span><span>(--ff-heading); </span><span><span class="hljs-attribute">margin-bottom</span></span><span>: .</span><span><span class="hljs-number">5em</span></span><span>; }
</span><span><span class="hljs-selector-tag">a</span></span><span><span class="hljs-selector-class">.btn</span></span><span> { </span><span><span class="hljs-attribute">display</span></span><span>: inline-block; </span><span><span class="hljs-attribute">padding</span></span><span>: .</span><span><span class="hljs-number">75em</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-number">1.25em</span></span><span>; </span><span><span class="hljs-attribute">background</span></span><span>: </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">var</span></span><span>(--clr-accent); </span><span><span class="hljs-attribute">color</span></span><span>: </span><span><span class="hljs-number">#fff</span></span><span>; </span><span><span class="hljs-attribute">border-radius</span></span><span>: </span><span><span class="hljs-number">4px</span></span><span>; </span><span><span class="hljs-attribute">text-decoration</span></span><span>: none; }
</span><span><span class="hljs-selector-tag">a</span></span><span><span class="hljs-selector-class">.btn</span></span><span><span class="hljs-selector-pseudo">:hover</span></span><span> { </span><span><span class="hljs-attribute">opacity</span></span><span>: .</span><span><span class="hljs-number">9</span></span><span>; }
</span><span><span class="hljs-selector-tag">html</span></span><span> { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
</li>
<li data-start="1594" data-end="1690">
<p data-start="1596" data-end="1690"><strong data-start="1596" data-end="1610">Global CSS</strong>: Paste the above into a <strong data-start="1635" data-end="1651">Sitewide CSS</strong> block or into your theme’s Custom CSS.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1692" data-end="1946">
<p data-start="1694" data-end="1718"><strong data-start="1694" data-end="1715">Stock‑Photo Style</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="1721" data-end="1946">
<li data-start="1721" data-end="1779">
<p data-start="1723" data-end="1779">Bright, minimal compositions with generous white space</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1782" data-end="1863">
<p data-start="1784" data-end="1863">Look for “workspace,” “team meeting,” “clean dashboard” on Unsplash or Pexels</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1866" data-end="1946">
<p data-start="1868" data-end="1946">Tones: neutral backgrounds (gray/white) + a pop of your orange accent in props</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1948" data-end="1951">
<h2 data-start="1953" data-end="1997">⚙️ 3. Section‑by‑Section with Code &amp; Copy</h2>
<h3 data-start="1999" data-end="2015">3.1 Navbar</h3>
<p data-start="2016" data-end="2066"><em data-start="2016" data-end="2066">No custom code needed—use SiteSwan’s Nav widget:</em></p>
<ul data-start="2068" data-end="2283">
<li data-start="2068" data-end="2110">
<p data-start="2070" data-end="2110"><strong data-start="2070" data-end="2078">Logo</strong> on left (upload <code data-start="2095" data-end="2107">ttlogo.png</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2111" data-end="2212">
<p data-start="2113" data-end="2212">Links: Services→#services, Portfolio→#portfolio, Hosting→#hosting, About→#about, Contact→#contact</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2213" data-end="2283">
<p data-start="2215" data-end="2283">Right‑aligned <strong data-start="2229" data-end="2254">“Get Your Free Quote”</strong> button linking to <code data-start="2273" data-end="2283">#contact</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
