  </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">h1</span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">style</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"font-size:3rem; max-width:800px; margin:0 auto;"</span></span><span>&gt;Transform Your Online Presence</span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">h1</span></span></span><span>&gt;
  </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span></span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-attr">style</span></span><span>=</span><span><span class="hljs-string">"font-size:1.25rem; margin:1rem 0;"</span></span><span>&gt;Polished portfolio sites &amp; transparent hosting—no hidden fees.</span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">br</span></span></span><span>&gt;Book a free strategy call &amp; see your vision come alive.</span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span></span></span><span>&gt;
