<hr data-start="3378" data-end="3381">
<h3 data-start="3383" data-end="3410">3.3 Services Overview</h3>
<p data-start="3411" data-end="3479"><strong data-start="3411" data-end="3421">Block:</strong> 3‑column built‑in “Feature” widgets, or Custom HTML grid.</p>
<p data-start="3481" data-end="3504"><strong data-start="3481" data-end="3504">Copy for each card:</strong></p>
<ol data-start="3506" data-end="3843">
<li data-start="3506" data-end="3611">
<p data-start="3509" data-end="3611"><strong data-start="3509" data-end="3530">Custom Web Design</strong><br data-start="3530" data-end="3533">
“Mobile‑first, brand‑driven websites that convert visitors into customers.”</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3613" data-end="3724">
<p data-start="3616" data-end="3724"><strong data-start="3616" data-end="3641">Responsive e‑Commerce</strong><br data-start="3641" data-end="3644">
“Seamless shopping experiences—fast, secure, and optimized for every device.”</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3726" data-end="3843">
<p data-start="3729" data-end="3843"><strong data-start="3729" data-end="3762">Managed Hosting &amp; Maintenance</strong><br data-start="3762" data-end="3765">
“99.9% uptime, daily backups, and 24/7 support—so you can focus on growth.”</p>
</li>
</ol>
