-col items-start justify-between text-start"><button class="flex w-full items-center gap-0.5"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 text-start align-middle text-token-text-secondary hover:text-token-text-primary" style="opacity: 1;">Thought for a few seconds</span><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-sm text-token-text-secondary inline align-middle transition-transform"><path d="M7.52925 3.7793C7.75652 3.55203 8.10803 3.52383 8.36616 3.69434L8.47065 3.7793L14.2207 9.5293C14.4804 9.789 14.4804 10.211 14.2207 10.4707L8.47065 16.2207C8.21095 16.4804 7.78895 16.4804 7.52925 16.2207C7.26955 15.961 7.26955 15.539 7.52925 15.2793L12.8085 10L7.52925 4.7207L7.44429 4.61621C7.27378 4.35808 7.30198 4.00657 7.52925 3.7793Z"></path></svg></button></div></div></span></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="713a0db1-39ae-404c-a97c-4b2a108029e8" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5" data-message-model-slug="o4-mini-high"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light"><p data-start="0" data-end="197">Below is a turnkey, section‑by‑section blueprint and all the code, copy, and setup steps you need to build your single‑page, conversion‑focused portfolio site—hosted on Netlify instead of SiteSwan.</p>
<hr data-start="199" data-end="202">
<h2 data-start="204" data-end="224">1. Page Blueprint</h2>
<p data-start="226" data-end="306">Each numbered section corresponds to an <code data-start="266" data-end="284">&lt;section id="…"&gt;</code> in your <code data-start="293" data-end="305">index.html</code>:</p>
<ol data-start="308" data-end="711">
<li data-start="308" data-end="335">
<p data-start="311" data-end="335"><strong data-start="311" data-end="321">Navbar</strong> (<code data-start="323" data-end="332">#navbar</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="336" data-end="359">
<p data-start="339" data-end="359"><strong data-start="339" data-end="347">Hero</strong> (<code data-start="349" data-end="356">#hero</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="360" data-end="400">
<p data-start="363" data-end="400"><strong data-start="363" data-end="384">Services Overview</strong> (<code data-start="386" data-end="397">#services</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="401" data-end="443">
<p data-start="404" data-end="443"><strong data-start="404" data-end="426">Portfolio Carousel</strong> (<code data-start="428" data-end="440">#portfolio</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="444" data-end="479">
<p data-start="447" data-end="479"><strong data-start="447" data-end="464">Hosting Plans</strong> (<code data-start="466" data-end="476">#hosting</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="480" data-end="508">
<p data-start="483" data-end="508"><strong data-start="483" data-end="495">About Me</strong> (<code data-start="497" data-end="505">#about</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="509" data-end="544">
<p data-start="512" data-end="544"><strong data-start="512" data-end="529">Process Steps</strong> (<code data-start="531" data-end="541">#process</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="545" data-end="591">
<p data-start="548" data-end="591"><strong data-start="548" data-end="571">Testimonials Slider</strong> (<code data-start="573" data-end="588">#testimonials</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="592" data-end="632">
<p data-start="595" data-end="632"><strong data-start="595" data-end="617">Contact &amp; Calendly</strong> (<code data-start="619" data-end="629">#contact</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="633" data-end="682">
<p data-start="637" data-end="682"><strong data-start="637" data-end="654">Cookie Banner</strong> (global, bottom‑floating)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="683" data-end="711">
<p data-start="687" data-end="711"><strong data-start="687" data-end="697">Footer</strong> (<code data-start="699" data-end="708">#footer</code>)</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="713" data-end="808">Smooth‑scroll nav, fully responsive, static only (HTML/CSS/JS), with Netlify Forms integration.</p>
<hr data-start="810" data-end="813">
<h2 data-start="815" data-end="842">2. Global Assets &amp; Setup</h2>
<h3 data-start="844" data-end="871">2.1 Directory structure</h3>
