      </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span></span></span><span>&gt;Hi, I’m </span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">strong</span></span></span><span>&gt;Damien Townsend</span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">strong</span></span></span><span>&gt;. With over 10 years building sites and 200+ happy clients, I help small businesses look modern and grow online.</span><span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span></span></span><span>&gt;
