</span></span></code></div></div></pre>
</li>
<li data-start="2914" data-end="3106">
<p data-start="2917" data-end="2963"><strong data-start="2917" data-end="2940">Download each image</strong> using the links above:</p>
<ul data-start="2967" data-end="3106">
<li data-start="2967" data-end="3027">
<p data-start="2969" data-end="3027">Right‑click the “Download” link and choose “Save link as…”</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3031" data-end="3106">
<p data-start="3033" data-end="3106">Save into <code data-start="3043" data-end="3062">your-site/assets/</code> with the exact filename shown in the table.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="3107" data-end="3312">
<p data-start="3110" data-end="3193"><strong data-start="3110" data-end="3124">(Optional)</strong> Add a <code data-start="3131" data-end="3141">.gitkeep</code> so Git tracks the folder even if you remove images:</p>
